  "intro": [
    "Fresh deterministic replay: seed 1035. Enter one command per prompt, in order. The route earns the full 200 points in 385 moves and reaches the rescue ending.",
    "The script prints a comic death banner once after a fall from the cage, then immediately says the report is exaggerated and you suffer only injured pride. The game continues without restarting or losing score; this is a nonfatal gag, not a death ending.",
    "For the finale, take the lion stand from the Lions\u2019 Den, put it in the ring and call for the net. Phone WPDL during its pledge appeal, then use the radio\u2019s classical music to calm Mahler on the wire. Do not let go until Chelsea has fallen into the net."
  ],
